# 11.34 fire20a (user 2026-10-16 "10–15 %로 조금 진하게" / "정점부터 호에 붉은 기 스밈"):
# 1) the lab harness fix - SpellLab308.Build points the rig's walker links at Lab_Walker, so the brush swing (SpellSwing308) and
# the swing ink (SwingInk308) run in the lab for the first time (fire1 - fire19 logged clip StanceIdle, bridges 0);
# 2) the ground stain at peak alpha .12. One cast at timeScale .25, recorded by rec:fire20a; brushlog prints BRUSH lines.
call SpellLab308 Run build
sleep 3
call Oheangbu.EditorTools.SpellVFX120.Vfx308Build Run build
sleep 3
call SpellLab308 Run play
wait lab
sleep 3
?call SwingProbe308 Run reset
?call SwingProbe308 Run on
?call SwingProbe308 Run target:6
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:0.25
?call SwingProbe308 Run ink
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:fire20a:34
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brushlog:6
?call SwingProbe308 Run cast:uB178
sleep 6
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 8
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
sleep 14
?call SwingProbe308 Run fx
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run top:lab_fire20a_end
?call SpellLab308 Run shot:lab_fire20a_end
?call SwingProbe308 Run slow:1
sleep 1
?call SwingProbe308 Run brush
?call SwingProbe308 Run report
mem
finally:
?call SpellLab308 Run rec:stop
?call SpellLab308 Run stop
sleep 6
